rVV10 nonlocal correlation (vdw_method rvv10, libvdwxc) on top of rPW86-PBE through libxc, which hands its
density gradient to the rVV10 term, for AB graphite at c = 6.70 A (one atom displaced along z): energy, forces and
stress in PW. Requires ENABLE_LIBXC and ENABLE_LIBVDWXC; listed in CASES_LIBVDWXC.txt. The reference was
generated with 4 MPI ranks.
